# The code pin of the supported disc's default.xex (skylanders-portal, src/xex/xex_header.h): where
# its code loads and the SHA-256 of the XEX header's page table from there on. That table holds a
# SHA-1 of every run of loaded pages, so another pressing with the same pin (another language set,
# another media ID) runs the same code, and the setup, the game and the launcher take it like a disc
# listed in default.xex.sha256.
823E0000:0dcab6aa8cfb5c82f42e603d165a1966615073bf1f4372bd1733cd5fcca3e31b
